{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏休み後編。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4日と5日について"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校が一緒だった仲良し3人で\n熱海行きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱海とか渋いね～という声が多いけど\nそんな渋いイメージなのね、熱海って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温泉でゆっくりしたさに熱海にしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前日に宿とるくらいの緩い旅"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンビーチをふらふら歩いたり\n温泉饅頭食べたり\nトリックアート迷宮館行ったり\n來宮神社や伊豆山神社行ったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで突然の飯ぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱海\nCAFE RoCAのぐりごおり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/10/9299225/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"静岡の銘茶 ぐり茶のかき氷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱海から帰って来て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京駅で仲良し4人で夜ご飯食べました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は安定のタコライス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらくすると\n突然の音楽と共に現れた誕生日プレート！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうなんです\n中田ともう一人が8月生まれだったんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい喋れたし\nお祝いしてもらえて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/10/9299225/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい楽しい夏休みでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/10/9299225/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなお休みだったから\nメンバーからお土産もらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなお土産ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/10/9299225/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんちゃんは\n完全に中田の好きなものくれて\nさすが過ぎました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/10/9299225/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなかりんちゃんに\n今日は暇すぎて\nかなりだる絡みしました(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}